<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Llanberis Bike Hire" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Llanberis Bike Hire - Route F: Lôn Las Ogwen: Bangor to Llyn Ogwen</name>
    <desc>From the sea at Bangor up into the mountains: old railway paths through the woods, past the Penrhyn slate quarry, and up the Nant Ffrancon valley to Llyn Ogwen, under Tryfan. Grade: Moderate. About 17.6 km with 359 m of climbing. Start: Porth Penrhyn, Bangor. Finish: Llyn Ogwen. Llanberis Bike Hire drops off and picks up. Route line drawn on OpenStreetMap data, © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL).</desc>
    <author><name>Llanberis Bike Hire</name></author>
    <link href="https://www.llanberisbikehire.co.uk"><text>Llanberis Bike Hire</text></link>
  </metadata>
